OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-hit farmer welcomes
OL,4,Aprevention projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who saw his land devastated by
OL,7,Fflooding has welcomed the allocation of
OL,8,Ffunding towards flood prevention
OL,9,Fmeasures.
OL,11,FSomerset Council has allocated a
OL,12,Fgovernment grant of #50m on flood
OL,13,Fprevention work, including dredging,
OL,14,Fimprovements to pumping stations and
OL,15,Fflood warning systems.
OL,17,FJames Winslade, a farmer near
OL,18,FBurrowbridge in Somerset who saw "every
OL,19,Fbit" of the family's 900 acres
OL,20,Funderwater in 2014, hopes the money can
OL,21,Fhelp prevent future disasters.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
