OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-hit farmer welcomes
OL,4,Aprevention projects
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's brilliant to have that money.
OL,7,FDredging and permanent pumps mean we
OL,8,Fcan get water moving a lot quicker,"
OL,9,Fsaid Winslade, adding he was keen for
OL,10,Fwork to be completed.
